 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "交易所的数据，不只留在交易所里。",
   "spoken": "交易所的数据，不只留在交易所里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.312,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.09
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "KYC 服务商、工单系统、邮件营销、物流、破产服务，每一家都是一个泄露点。",
   "spoken": "KYC 服务商、工单系统、邮件营销、物流、破产服务，每一家都是一个泄漏点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.132,
   "dur": 7.32,
   "speechStart": 5.23,
   "speechEnd": 11.611
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "2020 年 6 月，攻击者用一把第三方的 API 密钥，进了 Ledger 的电商和营销数据库。",
   "spoken": "2020 年 6 月，攻击者用一把第三方的 API 密钥，进了 Ledger 的电商和营销数据库。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.672,
   "dur": 7.248,
   "speechStart": 12.77,
   "speechEnd": 19.079
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "约 100 万个邮箱泄露，约 27.2 万条记录带着姓名、住址和电话。",
   "spoken": "约 100 万个邮箱泄漏，约 27.2 万条记录带着姓名、住址和电话。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 20.14,
   "dur": 6.552,
   "speechStart": 20.238,
   "speechEnd": 25.857
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "Ledger 后来修正为，约 29.2 万名客户。",
   "spoken": "Ledger 后来修正为，约 29.2 万名客户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 26.912,
   "dur": 4.488,
   "speechStart": 27.01,
   "speechEnd": 30.557
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "同年 12 月，完整的数据库，被公开在黑客论坛上。",
   "spoken": "同年 12 月，完整的数据库，被公开在黑客论坛上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 31.62,
   "dur": 4.992,
   "speechStart": 31.718,
   "speechEnd": 35.777
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "之后是大量钓鱼邮件和短信，还有针对客户的威胁电话。",
   "spoken": "之后是大量钓鱼邮件和短信，还有针对客户的威胁电话。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 36.832,
   "dur": 5.328,
   "speechStart": 36.93,
   "speechEnd": 41.311
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "硬件钱包本身没有被攻破。",
   "spoken": "硬件钱包本身没有被攻破。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 42.38,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 42.478,
   "speechEnd": 44.418
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "可谁买了硬件钱包，寄到了哪里，本身就是高价值的数据。",
   "spoken": "可谁买了硬件钱包，寄到了哪里，本身就是高价值的数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 45.48,
   "dur": 5.184,
   "speechStart": 45.578,
   "speechEnd": 49.816
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "2023 年 8 月，Kroll 一名员工的手机号，被 SIM 卡劫持。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 8 月，Kroll 一名员工的手机号，被 SIM 卡劫持。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 50.884,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 50.982,
   "speechEnd": 55.077
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "攻击者借此看到了 FTX、BlockFi、Genesis 三个破产案的债权人文件。",
   "spoken": "攻击者借此看到了 FTX、BlockFi、Genesis 三个破产案的债权人文件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 56.144,
   "dur": 7.008,
   "speechStart": 56.242,
   "speechEnd": 62.313
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "姓名、地址、邮箱，还有账户余额。",
   "spoken": "姓名、地址、邮箱，还有账户余额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 63.372,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 63.47,
   "speechEnd": 67.112
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "外包商员工的手机号，也成了你的攻击面。",
   "spoken": "外包商员工的手机号，也成了你的攻击面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 68.152,
   "dur": 3.576,
   "speechStart": 68.25,
   "speechEnd": 70.881
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "2024 年 1 月，Trezor 的第三方工单平台，遭到未授权访问。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 1 月，Trezor 的第三方工单平台，遭到未授权访问。",
